<view class="container">
  <view class="header card">
    <view class="header-title">创业咨询服务</view>
    <view class="header-desc">与失败创业者深度交流，获取真实经验</view>
  </view>

  <view class="empty card" wx:if="{{!hasAdvisors && !loading}}">
    <view class="empty-title">暂无可预约的导师</view>
    <view class="empty-desc">advisors 集合为空。需要先在云端创建该集合，<br />或在开发版执行一次「初始化演示数据」。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="advisors-list" wx:else>
    <view class="advisor-card card" wx:for="{{advisors}}" wx:key="_id">
      <view class="advisor-info">
        <image class="advisor-avatar" wx:if="{{item.avatar}}" src="{{item.avatar}}" mode="aspectFill" />
        <view class="advisor-initial" wx:else>{{item.initial}}</view>
        <view class="advisor-detail">
          <view class="advisor-name">
            {{item.name}}
            <text class="vip-tag" wx:if="{{item.isVip}}">👑VIP</text>
          </view>
          <view class="advisor-title">{{item.title}}</view>
          <view class="advisor-industry">
            <text class="tag" wx:if="{{item.industry}}">{{item.industry}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="advisor-stats">
        <view class="stat-item">
          <view class="stat-value">{{item.consultCount}}</view>
          <view class="stat-label">咨询次数</view>
        </view>
        <view class="stat-item">
          <view class="stat-value">{{item.ratingText}}</view>
          <view class="stat-label">评分</view>
        </view>
        <view class="stat-item">
          <view class="stat-value">
            <text class="price-now">¥{{item.displayPrice}}</text>
            <text class="price-was" wx:if="{{item.discounted}}">¥{{item.price}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="stat-label">/次</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="advisor-bio" wx:if="{{item.bio}}">{{item.bio}}</view>
      <view class="advisor-tags" wx:if="{{item.tags.length > 0}}">
        <text class="small-tag" wx:for="{{item.tags}}" wx:for-item="tag" wx:key="*this">{{tag}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="consult-btn {{item.discounted ? 'consult-btn-vip' : ''}}" bindtap="startConsult" data-id="{{item._id}}">
        {{item.discounted ? 'VIP 价预约' : '立即咨询'}}
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="my-consult card" wx:if="{{myConsultList.length > 0}}">
    <view class="section-title">我的咨询记录</view>
    <view class="consult-item" wx:for="{{myConsultList}}" wx:key="_id">
      <view class="consult-header">
        <text class="consult-advisor">{{item.advisorName}}</text>
        <text class="consult-status status-{{item.status}}">{{item.statusText}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="consult-time">
        {{item.timeText}} · ¥{{item.price}}<text wx:if="{{item.discounted}}">（VIP 8 折）</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="tips card">
    <view class="section-title">咨询须知</view>
    <view class="tips-list">
      <view class="tip-item">• 请提前准备好你的问题</view>
      <view class="tip-item">• 咨询时长一般为 30-60 分钟</view>
      <view class="tip-item">• 咨询采用语音或文字形式</view>
      <view class="tip-item">• VIP 会员咨询 8 折，其余功能不限次免费</view>
    </view>
    <view class="tip-warning">支付尚未接入：提交后生成的是「待支付」预约，不会扣款，导师也不会开始安排时间。</view>
  </view>
</view>
